---
import BlockLayout from '../../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
import { DEVNET, assertDevnetLaunchPinned } from '../../data/chain-home';
assertDevnetLaunchPinned();
const apps = [
  { title:'Start here', type:'Wallet & first steps', href:'/chain/start/', text:'Make a play key, review a transaction and try the devnet.' },
  { title:'Account Book', type:'Watch only', href:'/chain/accounts/', text:'Save public addresses with local labels and refresh their play balances.' },
  { title:'Daily Mint', type:'Collect', href:'/chain/daily-mint/', text:'Explore the daily play auction and its editions.' },
  { title:'Notary', type:'Write', href:'/chain/notary/', text:'Stamp a sentence on the devnet.' },
  { title:'Time Capsules', type:'Write', href:'/chain/capsules/', text:'Seal a message for later.' },
  { title:'Channels', type:'Explore', href:'/chain/channels/', text:'Read stations and their published posts.' },
  { title:'Receipt Desk', type:'Verify', href:'/chain/receipt/', text:'Look up a transaction hash and its observed status.' },
  { title:'Block Yard', type:'Verify', href:DEVNET.yardHref, text:'Explore blocks and check their proofs.' },
  { title:'Observatory', type:'Explore', href:'/chain/observatory/', text:'See chain activity and recent blocks.' },
  { title:'Chain docs', type:'Learn', href:'/chain/dev/', text:'Read the API, SDK and network documentation.' },
];
---
<BlockLayout title="PointCast Mist · a chain browser" description="Explore the PointCast devnet, its activity, and curated apps in a Mist-inspired browser." hideAds>
  <main class="mist" data-mist data-api={DEVNET.url} data-genesis={DEVNET.genesis} data-chain-id={DEVNET.chainId}>
    <header class="mast"><div><a class="brand" href="/chain/">POINTCAST / CHAIN</a><p class="overline">A browser for a small network</p><h1>PointCast Mist<span> β</span></h1><p class="lede">A window onto the chain and the things you can do there. Inspired by Ethereum’s early Mist browser, built for PointCast’s own devnet.</p></div><div class="network"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><b>PUBLIC DEVNET</b><small data-network>Connecting…</small></div></div></header>
    <p class="notice"><strong>Play network, real limits.</strong> One server runs this public, unmoderated devnet. Play ATTN has no promised value and the chain may reset. This is not Ethereum or an EVM wallet; it does not run arbitrary Ethereum apps. <a href="/chain/">About the chain</a></p>
    <div class="workspace"><aside aria-label="Browser navigation"><p class="side-label">YOUR WINDOW</p><nav><a href="#overview">◉ &nbsp; Overview</a><a href="#apps">▦ &nbsp; Applications</a><a href="#account">◎ &nbsp; Watch account</a><a href="#activity">≋ &nbsp; Recent activity</a></nav><p class="side-label">READY TO TRY?</p><p class="side-copy">Keys and signing stay in the existing PointCast apps. This page never asks for a private key.</p><a class="side-cta" href="/chain/start/">Open wallet setup ↗</a></aside>
      <div class="content"><section id="overview" aria-labelledby="overview-title"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="kicker">01 / NETWORK</p><h2 id="overview-title">The chain at a glance</h2></div><button type="button" data-refresh>Refresh</button></div><p class="status" data-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Checking network identity…</p><div class="metrics"><div><small>NETWORK</small><strong data-chain>—</strong></div><div><small>BLOCK HEIGHT</small><strong data-height>—</strong></div><div><small>ACCOUNTS</small><strong data-accounts>—</strong></div><div><small>MEMPOOL</small><strong data-mempool>—</strong></div></div><p class="fine">Numbers come from the devnet operator and are not independently verified here. <a href="/chain/verify-a-block/">Verify a block ↗</a></p></section>
      <section id="apps" aria-labelledby="apps-title"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="kicker">02 / APPLICATIONS</p><h2 id="apps-title">Open a room</h2></div><span class="eyebrow">CURATED BY POINTCAST</span></div><p class="section-intro">Each app opens on PointCast. This directory does not inject a wallet into other websites.</p><div class="app-grid">{apps.map((app) => <a class="app" href={app.href}><span class="app-type">{app.type}</span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><h3>{app.title}</h3><p>{app.text}</p></a>)}</div></section>
      <section id="account" aria-labelledby="account-title"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="kicker">03 / WATCH ONLY</p><h2 id="account-title">Look up an account</h2></div></div><p class="section-intro">Enter a public PointCast devnet address to read its balance and nonce. This does not connect a wallet or sign anything.</p><form class="account-form" data-account-form><label for="mist-address">Public address</label><div><input id="mist-address" data-address type="text" maxlength="80" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="tz1… or pca…" required /><button type="submit">Look up</button></div></form><div class="account-result" data-account-result role="status" aria-live="polite">No account selected.</div></section>
      <section id="activity" aria-labelledby="activity-title"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="kicker">04 / ACTIVITY</p><h2 id="activity-title">Recent transactions</h2></div><span class="eyebrow">NEWEST NONEMPTY BLOCKS</span></div><p class="section-intro">A public feed from the single devnet operator. Open a receipt to check a transaction’s reported status. Content is unmoderated.</p><div class="activity" data-activity><p>Waiting for the network…</p></div><p class="fine"><a href={DEVNET.yardHref}>Explore and verify in Block Yard ↗</a></p></section></div></div>
    <footer><span>POINTCAST / CHAIN</span><a href="/chain/dev/">Developer documentation ↗</a></footer>
    <noscript><p class="notice">JavaScript is needed for live network data and account lookup. The application links still work.</p></noscript>
  </main>
  <script is:inline type="module" src="/chain/apps/mist-browser.js"></script>
</BlockLayout>
<style>
  .mist{--ink:#242c31;--muted:#63717a;--line:#d8e0e0;--teal:#167b76;color:var(--ink);background:#f4f6f4;max-width:1600px;margin:auto;padding:clamp(18px,4vw,64px);font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}.mist *{box-sizing:border-box}.mist a{color:inherit}.mast{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:24px}.brand,.overline,.kicker,.side-label,.eyebrow{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}.brand{text-decoration:none;color:var(--teal)!important}.overline{margin:42px 0 10px;color:var(--muted)}h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}.mist h1{font-size:clamp(2.9rem,6vw,5.5rem);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin-bottom:14px}.mist h1 span{font-size:1rem;color:var(--teal);letter-spacing:0}.lede{max-width:650px;color:#566770;line-height:1.6}.network{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:#e2efeb;border:1px solid #c5e1d9;border-radius:8px;padding:14px 18px;min-width:170px;font-size:.75rem}.network small{display:block;margin-top:4px;color:var(--muted)}.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--teal)}.notice{margin:25px 0;padding:15px 18px;background:#fff5dc;border:1px solid #e4d2a9;border-radius:7px;font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.6}.workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:210px minmax(0,1fr);background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;min-height:700px}.workspace aside{background:#e9efed;border-right:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 17px}.side-label{color:#7a8a87;margin:0 0 12px}.workspace nav{display:grid;gap:3px;margin-bottom:35px}.workspace nav a{text-decoration:none;padding:11px 9px;border-radius:5px;font-size:.88rem;font-weight:650}.workspace nav a:hover{background:white}.side-copy{font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.6;color:#596b66}.side-cta{display:block;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--teal)!important}.content{padding:clamp(20px,3vw,45px);min-width:0}.content section{scroll-margin-top:20px;padding-bottom:42px;margin-bottom:40px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.content section:last-child{border:0;margin:0;padding-bottom:0}.section-head{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:14px}.kicker{color:var(--teal);margin-bottom:7px}.mist h2{font-size:clamp(1.45rem,3vw,2rem);letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:0}.section-intro,.fine{font-size:.84rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.status{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted)}button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;background:#176e69;color:white;border:1px solid #176e69;border-radius:5px;min-height:44px;padding:9px 16px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700}button:hover{background:#115a56}.mist :is(a,button,input):focus-visible{outline:3px solid #e59147;outline-offset:3px}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;overflow:hidden;margin:18px 0}.metrics div{background:#f9fbfa;padding:19px 15px}.metrics small{display:block;font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:800;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:9px}.metrics strong{font-size:1.1rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.app-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.app{display:block;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;padding:16px;min-height:155px;background:#fbfcfb}.app:hover{border-color:var(--teal);background:#f2faf7}.app-type{font-size:.66rem;color:var(--teal);font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.09em}.arrow{float:right;color:var(--teal)}.mist h3{font-size:1rem;margin:20px 0 6px}.app p{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45;margin:0}.account-form label{display:block;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:7px}.account-form div{display:flex;gap:8px}.account-form input{min-width:0;flex:1;border:1px solid #b8c8c4;border-radius:5px;padding:10px 12px;font:inherit}.account-result{margin-top:15px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.86rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.activity{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}:global(.activity-row){display:grid;grid-template-columns:95px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.84rem}:global(.activity-row > div){min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}:global(.activity-receipt){display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;font-weight:650;color:var(--teal)!important}:global(.activity-row b){color:var(--teal)}:global(.activity-row small){display:block;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.mist footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-top:30px;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700}@media(max-width:900px){.app-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:650px){.mast{display:block}.network{display:inline-flex;margin-top:8px}.workspace{display:block}.workspace aside{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.workspace nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0}.side-label,.side-copy,.side-cta{display:none}.workspace nav a{font-size:.8rem}.app-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.app{min-height:140px;padding:12px}.section-head{align-items:start}.eyebrow{display:none}.account-form div{flex-direction:column}:global(.activity-row){grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:3px}.mist footer{display:grid}}
</style>
